10
00:00:25,031 --> 00:00:27,298
Manual cleaning follows seven steps.

11
00:00:28,010 --> 00:00:29,789
Immerse the scope fully in the correct

12
00:00:29,789 --> 00:00:32,132
detergent, at the correct dilution and

13
00:00:32,132 --> 00:00:34,945
temperature. Wipe the exterior and

14
00:00:34,945 --> 00:00:38,443
insertion tube. Brush every channel, with

15
00:00:38,443 --> 00:00:40,762
the right brush for that model, until it

16
00:00:40,762 --> 00:00:42,549
comes out visibly clean.

17
00:00:43,226 --> 00:00:45,846
Then brush the ports, valves and elevator

18
00:00:45,846 --> 00:00:46,563
recess.

19
00:00:49,731 --> 00:00:52,315
Flush every channel with detergent, then

20
00:00:52,315 --> 00:00:55,039
water, using that model's connectors.

21
