25
00:01:09,598 --> 00:01:11,589
Why is brushing irreplaceable?

26
00:01:12,288 --> 00:01:14,512
Biofilm is organisms embedded in a

27
00:01:14,512 --> 00:01:16,912
protective matrix on the channel wall.

28
00:01:17,589 --> 00:01:19,724
Disinfectant can't penetrate it.

29
00:01:20,425 --> 00:01:22,445
Soaking and flushing flow straight over

30
00:01:22,445 --> 00:01:25,822
it. Only a brush, physically contacting

31
00:01:25,822 --> 00:01:27,525
the wall, breaks it up.

32
00:01:28,238 --> 00:01:30,505
That's why brush diameter matters!

33
00:01:33,631 --> 00:01:36,624
Next, high-level disinfection, usually in

34
00:01:36,624 --> 00:01:39,016
