39
00:01:48,485 --> 00:01:50,504
A channel that isn't connected isn't

40
00:01:50,504 --> 00:01:52,880
perfused, and isn't disinfected.

41
00:01:56,031 --> 00:01:58,122
The disinfectant must be at the correct

42
00:01:58,122 --> 00:02:00,659
concentration, temperature and contact

43
00:02:00,659 --> 00:02:03,878
time. Its minimum effective concentration

44
00:02:03,878 --> 00:02:06,366
is tested per protocol, and the solution

45
00:02:06,366 --> 00:02:09,238
is discarded at expiry, regardless of the

46
00:02:09,238 --> 00:02:12,255
test result. And never overload the

47
00:02:12,255 --> 00:02:13,260
reprocessor.

48
