Time for a knowledge check.

49
00:02:18,603 --> 00:02:20,454
Why can chemical disinfection not

50
00:02:20,454 --> 00:02:22,324
substitute for channel brushing?

51
00:02:22,978 --> 00:02:24,704
Pause here and think it through.

52
00:02:31,998 --> 00:02:34,606
Because biofilm, organisms embedded in a

53
00:02:34,606 --> 00:02:36,982
