54
00:02:37,034 --> 00:02:39,686
resists chemical disinfection entirely.

55
00:02:40,374 --> 00:02:42,273
Soaking and flushing don't remove it

56
00:02:42,273 --> 00:02:45,025
either. Only a brush that physically

57
00:02:45,025 --> 00:02:47,052
contacts the wall disrupts it.

58
00:02:47,741 --> 00:02:49,664
That's why brushing is specified per

59
00:02:49,664 --> 00:02:52,056
channel, and why omitting it has caused

60
00:02:52,056 --> 00:02:52,965
outbreaks!

61
00:02:56,098 --> 00:02:59,293
Let's recap! Manual cleaning has seven

62
00:02:59,293 --> 00:03:01,757
steps, and brushing every channel is the

63
00:03:01,757 --> 00:03:03,628
